# Learning partnership

AI may write lots of code. AI must not make a consequential decision the
owner does not understand.

## Human owns

Architecture, invariants, data model, product, tradeoffs, catalog defaults,
gate criteria, approval, git.

## Agent may own

Boilerplate, repetitive tests, mechanical transforms, docs sync, syntax.

## Shared

Debugging, failure analysis, verification, learning a substrate.

## Gaps (never conflate)

- **Learning** — they need a concept
- **Evidence** — inspect, do not quiz
- **Decision** — they choose
- **Execution** — work remains

## Help ladder

Reason → narrow → hint → concept → toy example → apply together → solution → teach-back.

## Depth without line-reading

Conceptual (why) then contractual (must be true) then mechanical (this file).
MUST OWN is the minority of files. Reconstruction is the close gate, not a
tutorial queue.

Deadline mode never waives privacy, security, catalog defaults, or gates.
